{"data": [{"author_id": "2110930195696025601", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:42:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120316179898306579"], "id": "2120316179898306579", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120265588052226454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu “Used to be a big research project, now it's a prompt” is the whole Al story in one line.\nThe hard part now is checking which details are real and which are just plausible.", "url": "https://x.com/cheeweng_/status/2120316179898306579"}, {"author_id": "46498861", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:00:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305592439111753"], "id": "2120305592439111753", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120265588052226454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu What used to need a government research program now comes from a prompt. That compression of effort is the real story. The question is no longer whether the model can rebuild a street, it is what we do when any place can be recreated on demand.", "url": "https://x.com/raulnogales/status/2120305592439111753"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:47:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120302474284216558"], "id": "2120302474284216558", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120302186139983984", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu @magolnick Rough order-of-magnitude: ~5–10 trillion frontier tokens.\n\nRecent agentic builds (e.g. Union Square SF, ~0.6 km² dense core with 450+ buildings, storefronts and limited interiors) used ~8 M tokens / $33. Scaling to the ~470 000 km² of global built-up land that houses 90 % of", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120302474284216558"}, {"author_id": "227528138", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:46:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120302186139983984"], "id": "2120302186139983984", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14859559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120298919120797992", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@magolnick @grok estimate many frontier model tokens it would take to create a faithful 3d reproduction of areas covering 90% of the world’s population. Give figures in dollars as well.", "url": "https://x.com/bilawalsidhu/status/2120302186139983984"}, {"author_id": "227528138", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:44:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120301548290887891"], "id": "2120301548290887891", "in_reply_to_user_id": "267633850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120299875396890664", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MrFiberNet Agreed! From your lips to @sundarpichai’s ears", "url": "https://x.com/bilawalsidhu/status/2120301548290887891"}, {"author_id": "267633850", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:37:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120299875396890664"], "id": "2120299875396890664", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120265588052226454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu Heres to hoping Google does this with street view so we dont have to", "url": "https://x.com/MrFiberNet/status/2120299875396890664"}, {"author_id": "14859559", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:33:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120298919120797992"], "id": "2120298919120797992", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120265588052226454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu 50 storefronts with interiors and basically zero manual modeling is wild. Main Street in 3D is getting close.", "url": "https://x.com/magolnick/status/2120298919120797992"}, {"author_id": "416466022", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:20:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120295555062796731"], "id": "2120295555062796731", "in_reply_to_user_id": "227528138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120287367475122203", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bilawalsidhu You didn't answer the question. The original post is a great little rendition of a small area. However, it does NOT scale globally.\n\nFurther, \"ground level 3d\" has many applications. The only one you promote is fancy videos, because that's why you're on this platform, which is", "url": "https://x.com/streleav/status/2120295555062796731"}, {"author_id": "227528138", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:50:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120287916648026378"], "id": "2120287916648026378", "in_reply_to_user_id": "104805570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120280179012768064", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@stevencheng hah i bet they're thrilled and gonna use these devleopments to get better deals from their usual primes", "url": "https://x.com/bilawalsidhu/status/2120287916648026378"}, {"author_id": "227528138", "created_at": "2026-11-10T22:49:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["21202876